  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-label=\"Pixel calculator\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"inputs\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. -3.5\" aria-label=\"Left number\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\" aria-label=\"Right number\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"operation\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\" aria-label=\"Operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "/* Pixel-style calculator */\n:root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --input-bg: #0f3460;\n  --border: #533483;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--border);\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n.inputs, .operation {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 8px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n}\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  margin: 8px 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border);\n}\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ff6b81;\n}\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--input-bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-align: right;\n  min-height: 2.5rem;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\nconst rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction parseNumber(value) {\n  if (value.trim() === '') return null;\n  const num = Number(value);\n  return Number.isFinite(num) ? num : null;\n}\n\nfunction calculate() {\n  const left = parseNumber(leftInput.value);\n  const right = parseNumber(rightInput.value);\n  if (left === null || right === null) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const operation = operationSelect.value;\n  let result;\n  switch (operation) {\n    case 'add': result = left + right; break;\n    case 'subtract': result = left - right; break;\n    case 'multiply': result = left * right; break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (right === 0) {\n        resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n        return;\n      }\n      result = left / right;\n      break;\n    default:\n      resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n  }\n  if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  resultOutput.textContent = String(result);\n}\n\ncalculateBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n// Initialize display to 0\nresultOutput.textContent = '0';",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA simple offline pixel-style calculator built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two number inputs (left and right) that support negative values.\n- Four operations: add, subtract, multiply, divide.\n- Output displays only the numeric result (initially `0`).\n- Validation: empty inputs, non-finite numbers, and division by zero show `Error`.\n- Keyboard accessible with labeled controls.\n- Responsive layout from 360px wide.\n- No external dependencies, network requests, or storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter numbers in the left and right fields.\n3. Select an operation from the dropdown.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter after focusing the button) to see the result.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and required IDs.\n- `style.css` – pixel-themed styling and responsive layout.\n- `script.js` – calculation logic and validation.\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
